questions.question:
Which import correctly matches this export?

```javascript
export default function Button() {
  return <button>Click me</button>;
}
```

Which import correctly matches this export?

```javascript
export function add(a, b) {
  return a + b;
}
```

What does this component render?

```javascript
function Welcome() {
  return <h1>Hello world</h1>;
}
```

What does this code do?

```javascript
function Greeting({ name }) {
  return <h1>Hello {name}</h1>;
}
```

If it is rendered as `<Greeting name="Ada" />`, what appears on the page?

What is wrong with this component?

```javascript
function Card() {
  return (
    <h2>Title</h2>
    <p>Description</p>
  );
}
```

What is the error in this JSX?

```javascript
function App() {
  return <img src="cat.png">;
}
```

What does this code do?

```javascript
function Profile({ username }) {
  return <p>User: {username}</p>;
}
```

If it is rendered as `<Profile username="sam" />`, what appears?

Consider this component:

```javascript
function Header({ title = 'Welcome' }) {
  return <h1>{title}</h1>;
}
```

What will `<Header />` render?

What is wrong with this code?

```javascript
function greeting() {
  return <h1>Hello</h1>;
}

export default greeting;
```

Later it is used like this:

```javascript
<greeting />
```

What is wrong with this code?

```javascript
function Greeting({ name }) {
  return <h1>Hello {name}</h1>;
}

function App() {
  return <Greeting username="Ada" />;
}
```
